	<PositioningEnabledTitle>自訂滑鼠定位</PositioningEnabledTitle>
	<PositioningEnabledExplained>啟用 Achtung 的右鍵定位、拖曳和隊形控制。</PositioningEnabledExplained>

	<AchtungModifierTitle>Achtung! 鍵</AchtungModifierTitle>
	<AchtungModifierExplained>定位時按住此鍵可徵召所選殖民者。用滑鼠右鍵拖曳時，他們會保持目前隊形。按住滑鼠右鍵後即可放開此鍵。使用 Q 和 E 旋轉隊形。</AchtungModifierExplained>

	<ForceCommandMenuModeTitle>右鍵模式</ForceCommandMenuModeTitle>
	<ForceCommandMenuKeyTitle>切換鍵</ForceCommandMenuKeyTitle>

	<CommandMenuModeOptionAuto>徵召狀態</CommandMenuModeOptionAuto>
	<CommandMenuModeOptionAutoExplained>根據殖民者的徵召狀態，在右鍵選單和定位之間選擇。</CommandMenuModeOptionAutoExplained>
	<CommandMenuModeOptionPressForMenu>選單鍵</CommandMenuModeOptionPressForMenu>
	<CommandMenuModeOptionPressForMenuExplained>按住此鍵可開啟右鍵選單，而不是執行預設動作。</CommandMenuModeOptionPressForMenuExplained>
	<CommandMenuModeOptionPressForPosition>定位鍵</CommandMenuModeOptionPressForPosition>
	<CommandMenuModeOptionPressForPositionExplained>按住此鍵可定位殖民者，而不是開啟右鍵選單。</CommandMenuModeOptionPressForPositionExplained>
	<CommandMenuModeOptionDelayed>長按開啟選單</CommandMenuModeOptionDelayed>
	<CommandMenuModeOptionDelayedExplained>按一下右鍵進行定位；按住按鈕達到設定時間後開啟右鍵選單。</CommandMenuModeOptionDelayedExplained>

	<DelayTitle>選單長按延遲</DelayTitle>
	<DelayExplained>開啟右鍵選單前需要按住右鍵的時間（毫秒）。</DelayExplained>

	<DraftedColonistDraggingModeTitle>已徵召殖民者</DraftedColonistDraggingModeTitle>
	<DraftedColonistDraggingModeExplained>選擇右鍵按下已徵召殖民者時，何時開始拖曳或隊形定位。</DraftedColonistDraggingModeExplained>
	<DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionOff>關閉</DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionOff>
	<DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionOffExplained>在已徵召殖民者上按右鍵不會開始拖曳。</DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionOffExplained>
	<DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionUnselected>未選取任何人</DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionUnselected>
	<DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionUnselectedExplained>僅在按右鍵前未選取任何可控制的殖民者時才開始拖曳。</DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionUnselectedExplained>
	<DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionAlways>一律</DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionAlways>
	<DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionAlwaysExplained>在已徵召殖民者上按右鍵時，一律允許拖曳或隊形定位。</DraftedColonistDraggingModeOptionAlwaysExplained>

	<RescueEnabledTitle>「工作」分頁中的「救援」欄</RescueEnabledTitle>
	<RescueEnabledExplained>新增「救援」工作優先度，讓殖民者自動將倒地的盟友送到床上。</RescueEnabledExplained>

	<ShowForceEndLetterTitle>強制工作結束時通知</ShowForceEndLetterTitle>
	<ShowForceEndLetterExplained>當殖民者沒有剩餘強制工作時顯示信件。</ShowForceEndLetterExplained>
	<KeepDraftedAndUndraftedCommandsSeparateTitle>分開徵召與未徵召命令</KeepDraftedAndUndraftedCommandsSeparateTitle>
	<KeepDraftedAndUndraftedCommandsSeparateExplained>將已徵召和未徵召殖民者的右鍵命令分開，與未安裝模組的 RimWorld 相同。</KeepDraftedAndUndraftedCommandsSeparateExplained>

	<ReplaceCleanRoomTitle>取代「清理房間」命令</ReplaceCleanRoomTitle>
	<ReplaceCleanRoomExplained>使用 Achtung 的徹底清理房間命令取代 RimWorld 的命令。</ReplaceCleanRoomExplained>

	<ReplaceFightFireTitle>取代「滅火」命令</ReplaceFightFireTitle>
	<ReplaceFightFireExplained>使用 Achtung 的徹底滅火命令取代 RimWorld 的命令。</ReplaceFightFireExplained>

	<ForcedCommandState>已命令其繼續工作，直到完成。</ForcedCommandState>

