	<IgnoreRestrictionsTitle>忽略活動區限制</IgnoreRestrictionsTitle>
	<IgnoreRestrictionsExplained>允許在殖民者的活動區之外執行強制工作。</IgnoreRestrictionsExplained>
	<IgnoreAssignmentsTitle>忽略工作優先度</IgnoreAssignmentsTitle>
